I've read the notice. The landlord is increasing the rent by 100.00 starting next month. To adjust the standing order, I need to check if there are any scheduled transactions (which would be the standing orders) and update them accordingly.

Let me first get the scheduled transactions to see what's currently set up:

<function=get_scheduled_transactions>{}

I can see there's a scheduled rent payment of 1100.0 on 2022-04-04 (ID: 7). According to the landlord notice, the rent will be increased by 100.00 starting next month. I need to update this transaction to increase the amount from 1100.0 to 1200.0.

Let me update the scheduled transaction:

<function=update_scheduled_transaction>{"id": 7, "amount": 1200.0}
